<title>HONG KONG: INTERVIEW-Hang Lung to buy HK$6 bln land.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW-Hang Lung to buy HK$6 bln land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hang Lung Development Co Ltd said on Monday it was likely to spend about HK$6 billion to acquire land in Hong Kong in calendar 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;We are very likely to spend about HK$6 billion,&quot; chairman Ronnie Chan said in an interview.</p>
<p>He said the firm planned to acquire about two million square feet of land in the territory this year.</p>
<p>&quot;Assuming a price of HK$3,000 per square foot, two million square feet will translate into HK$6 billion,&quot; Chan said.</p>
<p>-- Carrie Lee (852) 2843 6590</p>
